# Del Groups ERP Rules
- Tech Stack: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase (PostgreSQL).
- Canonical schema reference: `types/schema.sql`

## Gentelella ERP Design System (mandatory)

### Tokens (`src/design-system/`)
- **Source of truth:** `tokens.css` — all `--erp-*` variables. NO hardcoded colors in components.
- **Import:** `globals.css` → `design-system/index.css`
- **Typography:** `.erp-h1`–`.erp-h6`, `.erp-body`, `.erp-label`, `.erp-page-title`, `.erp-panel-title`
- Legacy `--gt-*` aliases map to `--erp-*` during migration.

### Component library (`@/components/ui` or `@/components/ui/index.ts`)
| Category | Components |
|----------|------------|
| Actions | `Button` — `appearance`: solid \| outline \| text; `color`: primary \| secondary \| success \| danger \| info \| warning; `size`: sm \| md \| lg |
| Forms | `Input`, `Select`/`SelectBox`, `Checkbox`, `Radio`, `FormLabel`, `ErrorMessage`, `FormField` |
| Layout sections | `Panel` (default section wrapper), `Card` (elevated/modal) |
| Data | `DataTable` (declarative), `Table`+`Pagination` (enterprise grids) |
| Feedback | `Badge`, `Alert`, `Modal`, `ToastMessage` |

### App shell (`@/components/layout/`)
- `AppLayout` / `PageLayout` — auth, command palette, AI widget
- `ERPLayout` — Gentelella shell (sidebar 230px, topbar 57px, content padding)
- `ERPPage` — page title + actions block

### Page rules
- Every page wraps in `PageLayout` (or `AppLayout`)
- Sections use `<Panel title="…">` — not raw divs with custom borders
- Forms: 12-col grid `lg:col-span-8` / `lg:col-span-4` sticky summary on complex pages
- Tables: `DataTable` for simple lists; `Table` primitives for bulk/pagination
- Buttons: only `@/components/ui/button` — no gradients, `rounded-[var(--erp-radius-md)]`
